{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-toolbox#card-zh","repo":"qlheric/dsh-toolbox","commit":"6b9c33cdd1adc70511e99b52fe54aa73ab2485fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toolbox 是一个面向 DSH Web 和桌面 profile 的工具插件，通过 tools 注册十个数据处理工具。已读实现包括按路径查询、检查和格式化 JSON，计算常见数学表达式，对文本编码解码、生成摘要或 UUID，比较文本与 JSON 差异，以及解析和换算时间。工具以输入参数返回结构化结果，适合需要在 DSH 工作流中处理文本、数据和时间的用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务；需使用兼容版本的 DSH 与 Node.js。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-42","cordis.patch.yml:1-8","lib/json.js:1-9","lib/calculator.js:1-6","lib/encoding.js:1-9","lib/diff.js:1-9","lib/time.js:1-10"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-toolbox#card-en","repo":"qlheric/dsh-toolbox","commit":"6b9c33cdd1adc70511e99b52fe54aa73ab2485fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-toolbox registers ten local data tools with DSH. Its inspected modules query JSON, evaluate expressions, encode or hash text, compare text and JSON, and convert times. Results are returned as structured data. No API key or external service is required; compatible DSH and Node.js are needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-42","cordis.patch.yml:1-8","lib/json.js:1-9","lib/calculator.js:1-6","lib/encoding.js:1-9","lib/diff.js:1-9","lib/time.js:1-10"]}
