{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-toolbox#feature-1","repo":"qlheric/dsh-toolbox","commit":"6b9c33cdd1adc70511e99b52fe54aa73ab2485fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toolbox 的功能「JSON 路径查询」：从 JSON 数据中按点号、键名或数组下标定位值，也可列出键、查看类型、校验或格式化 JSON。调用 json 工具并提供查询动作与路径，返回匹配结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/json.js:1-9"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-toolbox#feature-2","repo":"qlheric/dsh-toolbox","commit":"6b9c33cdd1adc70511e99b52fe54aa73ab2485fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toolbox 的功能「数学表达式计算」：计算器解析含四则运算、取模、幂、括号和常见数学函数的表达式。调用 calculator 工具提交表达式，获得数值结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/calculator.js:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-toolbox#feature-3","repo":"qlheric/dsh-toolbox","commit":"6b9c33cdd1adc70511e99b52fe54aa73ab2485fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toolbox 的功能「编码与摘要」：对文本进行 base64、base64url、URL 或十六进制编码和解码，也可生成摘要或 v4 UUID。调用 encoding 工具选择动作和参数，结果以结构化数据返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/encoding.js:1-9"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-toolbox#feature-4","repo":"qlheric/dsh-toolbox","commit":"6b9c33cdd1adc70511e99b52fe54aa73ab2485fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toolbox 的功能「差异比较」：比较两段文本并生成 unified diff，也支持 JSON 路径级差异和 CSV 行差异。调用 diff 工具提供比较模式及两份内容，获取变更结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/diff.js:1-9"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-toolbox#feature-5","repo":"qlheric/dsh-toolbox","commit":"6b9c33cdd1adc70511e99b52fe54aa73ab2485fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toolbox 的功能「时间换算」：解析严格 ISO 时间并按指定时区呈现，支持时间增减与两个时间点间隔计算。调用 time 工具选择动作并提供时间及相应单位，获得换算后的时间信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/time.js:1-10"]}
